id=nomount
metamodule=true
name=NoMount (Built-in)
version=v2.0.0
versionCode=20000
author=maxsteeel + APatch
description=A built-in metamodule (dev branch) that replaces OverlayFS/MagicMount with VFS path redirection, with WebUI and UID isolation. Works with kernels that have NoMount built-in (CONFIG_NOMOUNT=y) or via a matching nomount LKM.
